{%- assign component_class = 'pima-journey-manifesto__' | append: section.id -%}

{%- comment -%}
  IMPORTANT: do NOT let auto-formatters break the CSS selectors below into
  multiple lines. The class is built from Liquid `{{ component_class }}` +
  BEM suffix (e.g. `__inner`). If a formatter inserts a newline between them,
  CSS parses two separate selectors and the styles silently fail.
  Keep each `.{{ component_class }}__xxx` on a single line.
  (See `.prettierrc` / `.editorconfig` if your editor reformats Liquid CSS.)
{%- endcomment -%}

<style>
  .{{ component_class }} { background: #fff; padding: 120px 0; }
  .{{ component_class }}__inner { max-width: 1300px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 64px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 96px; }
  .{{ component_class }}__left { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .{{ component_class }}__heading-block { border-left: 3px solid #111; padding-left: 22px; padding-bottom: 80px; }
  .{{ component_class }}__title { font-family: var(--font-display, sans-serif); font-size: clamp(26px, 2.8vw, 42px); font-weight: 900; color: #111; line-height: 1.05; margin: 0 0 8px; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .{{ component_class }}__subtitle { font-family: var(--font-display, sans-serif); font-size: clamp(22px, 2.5vw, 38px); font-weight: 900; color: #111; line-height: 1.18; margin: 0; }
  .{{ component_class }}__icon { margin-top: 32px; width: 130px !important; height: 130px !important; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .{{ component_class }}__icon img { width: 130px !important; height: 130px !important; max-width: none !important; object-fit: contain; display: block; }
  @media (min-width: 750px) and (max-width: 1280px) {
    .{{ component_class }}__icon, .{{ component_class }}__icon img { width: 110px !important; height: 110px !important; }
  }
  .{{ component_class }}__body p { font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif); font-size: clamp(16px, 1.25vw, 19px); font-weight: 400; color: #111; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 22px; }
  .{{ component_class }}__body p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .{{ component_class }} { padding: 52px 0; }
    .{{ component_class }}__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; padding: 0 24px; }
    .{{ component_class }}__title { font-size: clamp(22px, 6vw, 32px); }
    .{{ component_class }}__subtitle { font-size: clamp(20px, 5.5vw, 28px); }
    .{{ component_class }}__icon { display: none; }
    .{{ component_class }}__body p { font-size: 15px; }
  }
</style>

<section class="{{ component_class }}">
  <div class="{{ component_class }}__inner">
    <div class="{{ component_class }}__left">
      <div class="{{ component_class }}__heading-block">
        {%- if section.settings.title != blank -%}
          <h2 class="{{ component_class }}__title">{{ section.settings.title }}</h2>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if section.settings.subtitle != blank -%}
          <p class="{{ component_class }}__subtitle">{{ section.settings.subtitle }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      {%- assign icon_src = '' -%}
      {%- if section.settings.icon_filename != blank -%}
        {%- assign icon_src = section.settings.icon_filename | asset_url -%}
      {%- elsif section.settings.icon_image != blank -%}
        {%- assign icon_src = section.settings.icon_image | img_url: '160x' -%}
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if icon_src != blank -%}
        <div class="{{ component_class }}__icon">
          <img src="{{ icon_src }}" alt="Dunkelvolk" loading="lazy" width="130" height="130">
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    <div class="{{ component_class }}__right">
      {%- if section.settings.body != blank -%}
        <div class="{{ component_class }}__body">{{ section.settings.body }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Pima Journey: Manifiesto",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "Título",
      "default": "THE ART OF JOURNEY"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "subtitle",
      "label": "Subtítulo",
      "default": "no es escapar, es elegir moverse con intención."
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "body",
      "label": "Texto (columna derecha)",
      "default": "<p>No todo viaje se mide en distancia. Algunos se miden con las emociones que nos generan.</p><p>Este journey representa la nueva identidad de Dunkelvolk, un explorador consciente que entiende el movimiento como una forma de conexión.</p><p>No se trata de llegar más lejos, sino de moverse con propósito.</p><p>Explorar es salir, descubrir y observar, pero también es detenerse, sentir y entender.</p><p>Cada paso construye. Cada experiencia transforma. Porque al final, no somos el destino al que llegamos, sino el viaje que elegimos hacer.</p><p>¿Desde la mirada de Lorenzo Urbina, filmmaker documentalista, este journey retrata una historia de conexión con uno mismo. Un viaje que empezó desde la curiosidad... y que terminó conectándolo con si mismo.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "icon_filename",
      "label": "Icono (assets/)",
      "info": "Ej: iconodunk.webp — tiene prioridad sobre image picker",
      "default": "iconodunk.webp"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "icon_image",
      "label": "Icono (Shopify Files)"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Pima Journey: Manifiesto",
      "settings": {
        "title": "THE ART OF JOURNEY",
        "subtitle": "no es escapar, es elegir moverse con intención.",
        "icon_filename": "iconodunk.webp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
